Package: soplos-icons
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Sergi Perich <info@soploslinux.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/SoplosLinux/soplos-icons
Description: Soplos Icons, the original icon theme of Soplos Linux
 An original SVG icon theme in amber, orange, red and graphite, installed in
 /usr/share/icons/Soplos. It depends on no other package. Icons it does not
 have are looked for in the Adwaita, Breeze and hicolor themes, when they are
 installed.
 .
 Artwork by Sergi Perich and Juanjo Menent.
 Build date: 2026-11-27
